  "body": "We are absolutely thrilled to introduce this luxury penthouse apartment at Kauri Residences, vendors committed to sell so don't miss the opportunity, give us a call now for a viewing 022 0410180. \r\n\r\nBehold this extraordinary 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom 1-study penthouse that epitomises luxury living. Its contemporary design harmonises seamlessly with its enviable location, just a mere 300 meters from the pristine Browns Bay beach.\r\n\r\nStep into the capacious kitchen, a haven for culinary enthusiasts, furnished with top-tier appliances, including integrated French door fridge/freezer. This kitchen is your canvas, whether you're orchestrating an intimate gathering or crafting a gourmet masterpiece.\r\n\r\nWith a meticulously planned layout encompassing a total of 126 square meters floor area including the 28 square meters under-cover private patio.\r\n\r\nThe generous outdoor living area is a sanctuary of serenity, complete with a cedar hot tub, beckoning you to relax and soak in the tranquillity. The central air-conditioning adds a touch of warmth and refinement, ensuring year-round enjoyment of this space.\r\n\r\nDesigned by the esteemed Matz Architects, this penthouse is a testament to unparalleled craftsmanship and meticulous attention to detail. With its completion, you now have the unique opportunity to be the first to relish the luxurious lifestyle offered by this exceptional residence.\r\n\r\nSituated in close proximity to Browns Bay beach, you'll relish easy access to a vibrant coastal lifestyle. Enjoy leisurely strolls along the sandy shores, explore the enchanting local boutiques and dining spots, or simply immerse yourself in the natural beauty that envelops you.\r\n\r\nCall Sally now for a viewing 022 041 0180",
